# kamakalawa, "the day before yesterday".  Its mirror, makalawa ("the day
# after tomorrow"), is NOT shipped: the same bare word is also the frequency
# adverb "twice", the named-day grammar matches it bare, and no source gives
# a disambiguator that survives tokenization.  en.wiktionary.org, kamakalawa;
# en.wiktionary.org, makalawa.
kamakalawa
